        <detaileddescription>
<para>Bitfield that contains some basic information about the message: -Bit 0: Is the message an extended ID message, or a standard ID message? 1 For extended. -Bits 1:2 Which CANbus is being used to send the message? 00-&gt; whatever the default is 01 -&gt; CAN1 10 -&gt; CAN2 11-&gt; CAN3 (doesnt exist yet). Will default to CAN1 if all zeros </para>
        </detaileddescription>
